  "recommendations": [
    "Hero content on home page → WP Customizer settings (hero_title, hero_subtitle, hero_eyebrow)",
    "Category grid → dynamic from WC product categories (wc_get_product_category_list)",
    "Popular products → WP_Query or wc_get_products with meta_key for 'popular'",
    "product.html color picker → WC variable product variations (display-only, no cart)",
    "All 'Подробнее' buttons → NOT add_to_cart, link to product page",
    "Lead form → CF7 single form, reuse via shortcode on all pages",
    "Footer catalog links → dynamic from WC categories",
    "About page timeline → ACF repeater field",
    "object-contain on ALL product images (owner requirement)",
    "NO hardcoded hex colors outside :root block",
    "WC Catalog Mode: удалить цену из корзины, убрать checkout, убрать cart page"
  ]
